    <string name="music_info_what_title">What this is</string>
    <string name="music_info_what">This app is for making a music video for your song. It guides you through every part and teaches you what you need as you go. You don't need any video experience. It is built so the video comes out high quality and the way you imagined it.</string>
    <string name="music_info_why_title">The why</string>
    <string name="music_info_why">This app exists because I wanted music videos of my own, and a proper one costs a lot, needs a lot of people, and can still go wrong. AI made another way possible. I worked that way out for myself and turned it into this app.</string>
    <string name="music_info_belief_title">The belief</string>
    <string name="music_info_belief">AI has changed what one person can do. My background is IT, and I used it to build something that does not exist anywhere else.\n\nIf you want to tell your story and have it come out exactly as you mean it. That is what this is about.</string>
    <string name="music_info_goal_title">The goal</string>
    <string name="music_info_goal">The goal is to make the best music videos, tell your story with them, and put them out for the world to see.</string>
    <string name="music_info_service_title">Service and cost</string>
    <string name="music_info_service">The app costs nothing. It runs on my own servers and I only have so much capacity. Sometimes it will be slow. Sometimes it will fail. If you want fast and reliable, there are paid options.</string>
    <string name="music_info_enter">Enter</string>

    <string name="care_login_what_title">What this is</string>
    <string name="care_login_what">This is a multiplatform domicilary care software. It runs on desktop, mobile and web. It makes running domiciliary care simple and efficient. You don't need clinical expertise to use this tool. It's designed to be easy to use and simple.</string>
    <string name="care_login_why_title">The why</string>
    <string name="care_login_why">I supported the technical operations of a domiciliary care company and saw inefficient processes everywhere. I solved each independently before eventually deciding to turn into all to a full system.</string>
    <string name="care_login_belief_title">The belief</string>
    <string name="care_login_belief">My background is in IT and I used technology to make things easier. Providing care and supporting people shouldn't be something made inconvenient because of inefficient processes that technology can solve. If it can be better, then I'd like to see it become a reality</string>
    <string name="care_login_goal_title">The goal</string>
    <string name="care_login_goal">Make running a homecare business through modern technology an extremely easy convenient operation.</string>
    <string name="care_login_service_title">Service and cost</string>
    <string name="care_login_service">You run it on your own servers, which makes it free. You can also use this as is for a test drive.</string>
    <string name="care_login_how_title">How to use</string>
    <string name="care_login_how">To use this, you need to login via matrix.</string>
    <string name="care_login_enter">Login</string>

